repository-code: "https://github.com/dagmarfraser/power-law-test-retest"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code, with supplementary R models, for a test-retest reliability
  study of the speed-curvature power law (the exponent beta) measured from
  Apple Pencil drawing on an iPad. It takes raw session files to trial-level
  beta and kinematics, between-visit reliability (ICC), and the sensitivity,
  stability and robustness analyses.
keywords:
  - speed-curvature power law
  - two-thirds power law
  - test-retest reliability
  - intraclass correlation
  - motor control
  - drawing kinematics
  - MATLAB
